'''Hell Warden Emma''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] increases her health and chance to Weaken, and grants [[Immune to Freeze|Immunity to Freeze]] and [[Immune to Warp|Warp]]. [[Talents]] were also added in Version 12.7.

