==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], all of Emma's English descriptions stated that she had [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]] instead of the [[Wave Shield]] ability.
*There is a typo in Hell Commissioner Emma's English description, in that the first line is missing an "a" before crusade.
*Hell Commissioner Emma is tied with [[Wafer Cat (Special Cat)|Wafer Cat]] and [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] for the third highest base health of all units, only beaten by [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] and [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]].
*Emma's name is one letter off from Enma: the Japanese name for [[w:Yama (Buddhism)|Yama]], the Buddhist and East Asian god of Hell and death.
*The kanji on Emma's headwear is 王, meaning king/emperor.
**This detail is shared with [[Lord Enma]], a character that also references the god Yama.
*Hell Warden Emma's appearance and name reference ''[[wikia:jump:Gokutei Higuma|Hell Warden Higuma]]''.

